  "theoryOfChange": "The Union of Concerned Scientists (UCS) has a published \"UCS Strategic Plan 2023-2027,\" which they refer to as a \"five-year strategic framework.\" This framework outlines their approach, reflecting \"bold new investments in science and scientists; more teamwork across our programs, campaigns, and partnerships; and a firm conviction that it is possible to create a better future.\" The plan details how UCS is \"bringing science to this critical moment\" to address challenges such as a heating planet, democracy under assault, and nuclear threats. Additionally, UCS has published \"A Transformative Climate Action Framework,\" which provides guidance for the transition to a clean, just, and resilient economy, emphasizing people-centered approaches and addressing inequities.",
